{"id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-satisfaction.md","title":"Satisfaction","display":"df-satisfaction — Satisfaction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-satisfaction","aliases":["17-df-satisfaction"],"display":"df-satisfaction — Satisfaction","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-term]]","[[17-df-formula]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-assignment]]","[[17-df-term-interpretation]]"],"source_section":"1.3","source_result":"1.3.14–1.3.15","source_pages_print":[28],"source_pages_djvu":[44],"source_verification":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation","label_origin":"local-catalog","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction — Satisfaction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c40994941c97c4da\" href=\"?note=c40994941c97c4da\" title=\"17-df-term\">17-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"aa8b746e678731ad\" href=\"?note=aa8b746e678731ad\" title=\"17-df-term-interpretation\">17-df-term-interpretation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3"},{"key":"source_result","html":"1.3.14–1.3.15"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>44</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)\\)</span>，分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>。项、公式及项解释分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c40994941c97c4da\" href=\"?note=c40994941c97c4da\" title=\"17-df-term\">17-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"aa8b746e678731ad\" href=\"?note=aa8b746e678731ad\" title=\"17-df-term-interpretation\">17-df-term-interpretation</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,w\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\">\\(u,w\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\)</span> 是等式分支的两个独立输入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi,\\psi_1,\\psi_2\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi,\\psi_1,\\psi_2\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span>。关系分支的局部参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^n\">\\(\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^n\\)</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq i\\leq n\">\\(1\\leq i\\leq n\\)</span> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i=\\bar t(i-1)\">\\(t_i=\\bar t(i-1)\\)</span>；不假设关系符号类非空。量词分支取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span> 由该分支的量词绑定。原子关系的解释以有限序列为元素。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_L\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> 上按下式递归定义；递归同时涵盖该结构的所有赋值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi)\n\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\n\\begin{cases}\nu^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]=w^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\n&amp;\\varphi=(u=w),\\\\\n\\langle t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathfrak A},\n&amp;\\varphi=R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\\\\n\\neg\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\psi),\n&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi,\\\\\n\\neg\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\psi_1)\\lor\n\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\psi_2),\n&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi_1\\to\\psi_2),\\\\\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x],\\psi),\n&amp;\\varphi=\\forall x\\,\\psi,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models\\varphi\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi)\n\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\n\\begin{cases}\nu^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]=w^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\n&amp;\\varphi=(u=w),\\\\\n\\langle t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathfrak A},\n&amp;\\varphi=R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\\\\n\\neg\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\psi),\n&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi,\\\\\n\\neg\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\psi_1)\\lor\n\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\psi_2),\n&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi_1\\to\\psi_2),\\\\\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x],\\psi),\n&amp;\\varphi=\\forall x\\,\\psi,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathfrak A,\\beta\\models\\varphi\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The five clauses cover exactly the formula constructors in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>.</li>\n<li>The recursion is the book-17 notation for <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"c40994941c97c4da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-term-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"aa8b746e678731ad","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-term-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$；$\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)$，分别见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]、[[17-df-structure]]、[[17-df-assignment]]。项、公式及项解释分别见 [[17-df-term]]、[[17-df-formula]]、[[17-df-term-interpretation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-8","targe