ign}(A)$，分别见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]、[[17-df-structure]]、[[17-df-assignment]]。项、公式及项解释分别见 [[17-df-term]]、[[17-df-formula]]、[[17-df-term-interpretation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The five clauses cover exactly the formula constructors in [[17-df-formula]].","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The recursion is the book-17 notation for [[17-df-satisfaction]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"u,w\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi,\\psi_1,\\psi_2\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L^n","display":false},{"tex":"1\\leq i\\leq n","display":false},{"tex":"t_i=\\bar t(i-1)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi)\n\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\n\\begin{cases}\nu^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]=w^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\n&\\varphi=(u=w),\\\\\n\\langle t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathfrak A},\n&\\varphi=R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\\\\n\\neg\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\psi),\n&\\varphi=\\neg\\psi,\\\\\n\\neg\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,\