locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sat}_L$ (satisfaction, see [[17-df-satisfaction]])"},{"id":"3784f7fc076663f9","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。$\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 且 $f[A]=B$，见 [[17-df-embedding]]。$s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)$、$u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L$，项解释见 [[17-df-term-interpretation]]；$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L$，$\\mathrm{Sat}_L$ 见 [[17-df-satisfaction]]。$f\\circ s$ 为通常函数复合；$\\equiv_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"ee38febe67086306","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$、$s,t\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)$，见 [[17-df-term-interpretation]] 与 [[17-df-satisfaction]]。$u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L$、$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L$；$\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L,\\mathrm{FreeVar}$ 见 [[17-df-free-variable]]。"},{"id":"a56231382327ecde","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}$ and $\\operatorname{Sat}_L$ (assignments and satisfaction, see [[17-df-assignment]] and [[17-df-satisfaction]])"},{"id":"ca75e0773ad7e836","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}$ and $\\operatorname{Sat}_L$ (assignments and satisfaction, see [[17-df-assignment]] and [[17-df-satisfaction]])"},{"id":"378c046219546f74","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\models$ (parameter satisfaction, see [[17-df-satisfaction]])"},{"id":"000da1f2ba1de849","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]；包含映射使用该依赖中定义的 $\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}$。$\\mathrm{Assign}(A)$ 与赋值更新见 [[17-df-assignment]]；$\\mathrm{Sat}_L$、$\\mathrm{Form}_L$ 见 [[17-df-